---
<section class="engagement-modes">
    <p class="eyebrow">MODES / HOW WE WORK</p>
    <h2>Deep Integration, High Output.</h2>
    <div class="modes-grid">
        <div class="mode-card">
            <span class="badge">STRATEGIC CONSULTING</span>
            <h3>Zero-to-One Architecture</h3>
            <p>Solving specialized bottlenecks. Whether it's crypto-native payments, brand evolution, or high-scale infra, we provide the elite senior depth to unblock your build.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="mode-card">
            <span class="badge">CO-BUILDING</span>
            <h3>Successive Core Blocks</h3>
            <p>We join your team for multi-week booking slots. We don't just advise; we ship. We operate as your elite engineering and design wing.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="mode-card">
            <span class="badge">VENTURE CREATION</span>
            <h3>Internal & Community Ventures</h3>
            <p>From incubating internal WE3 prototypes to sourcing high-signal community ideas. We transform concepts into standalone operating companies.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    .engagement-modes {
        margin: var(--spacing-large) 0;
        padding-top: var(--spacing-large);
        border-top: 1px solid var(--ag-border);
    }
    .eyebrow {
        font-family: var(--typography-font-family-mono);
        color: var(--ag-accent);
        font-size: 0.7rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    }
    h2 { font-size: 2.2rem; margin: 0.5rem 0 2rem; }
    
    .modes-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
        gap: var(--spacing-medium);
    }
    .mode-card {
        padding: 2rem;
        background: var(--ag-surface);
        border: 1px solid var(--ag-border);
        border-radius: var(--effect-radius-large);
        transition: all 0.3s ease;
    }
    .mode-card:hover { border-color: var(--ag-accent); transform: scale(1.02); }
    .mode-card h3 { margin: 1rem 0; font-size: 1.5rem; }
    
    .badge {
        font-family: var(--typography-font-family-mono);
        font-size: 0.65rem;
        color: var(--ag-accent);
        border: 1px solid var(--ag-accent);
        padding: 2px 8px;
        border-radius: 4px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
        .modes-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }
</style>
